.packages/

## CI places NUGET_PACKAGES INSIDE the workspace (.github/workflows/ci.yml, `env`):
## `${{ github.workspace }}/.nuget/packages`. The package cache is not source, and
## if it is NOT ignored, the clean-tree gate of `dotnet pack` (TRACON0004) stops
## every package - the gate counts an untracked file as dirty too.
.nuget/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
TestResults/
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

