yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
test-results/

## Vite build output. Embedded in the package, not kept in the source tree.
src/Tracon.UI/wwwroot/

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## packages/ (npm packages)
## `tsc` output - it is published to npm, not kept in the source tree. `src/schema.ts`
## is GENERATED but committed (a schema-drift test checks it); dist/ stays uncommitted.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
packages/*/dist/

