## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Documentation site (docs-site/) and API reference (docfx/)
## The site is a SEPARATE publishing pipeline; it is not tied to `dotnet build`.
## Generated content is NOT committed - its sources are the assemblies and the OpenAPI snapshot.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs-site/dist/
docs-site/.astro/
docs-site/src/content/docs/api/
docs-site/src/content/docs/http-api/
docs-site/src/content/docs/reference/changelog.md
docs-site/src/content/docs/reference/releases/
docs-site/src/generated/
docs-site/public/openapi/
docs-site/public/landing/
docfx/api-md/
docfx/_site/

